ato.jpg?v=008b0f3a" length="224093" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/timorasso-vitigno-salvato.jpg?v=008b0f3a" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>蓝布鲁斯科：从来就不是“廉价酒”的廉价酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.27/lanbulusike-congwei-shi-lianjia-jiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.27/lanbulusike-congwei-shi-lianjia-jiu/</guid><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>Sorbara、Grasparossa、Salamino：蓝布鲁斯科是一个葡萄品种家族，而不只是出口的甜酒。历史、DOC产区、瓶中二次发酵与艾米利亚的餐桌。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/lambrusco-non-e-un-vino-da-poco.jpg?v=54c26e49" length="274321" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/lambrusco-non-e-un-vino-da-poco.jpg?v=54c26e49" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>被遗忘的葡萄品种：意大利为何重新发现失落的葡萄</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.26/beiyiwang-putao-pinzhong-yidali-chongxin-faxian/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.26/beiyiwang-putao-pinzhong-yidali-chongxin-faxian/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>葡萄品种</category><description>从Verdiso到Pecorino，从Raboso到Cagnulari：如何拯救一个濒临灭绝的品种，以及本土品种的风潮为何也有风险。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vitigni-dimenticati-che-tornano.jpg?v=88207a6e" length="169886" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/vitigni-dimenticati-che-tornano.jpg?v=88207a6e" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>Chianti与Chianti Classico：两款相邻却并不相像的酒</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.26/chianti-yu-chianti-classico-liang-kuan-xianglin-de-jiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.26/chianti-yu-chianti-classico-liang-kuan-xianglin-de-jiu/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 26 S