24/sading-dao-cannonau-vermentino-putaojiu/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.24/sading-dao-cannonau-vermentino-putaojiu/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>Cannonau的身世之争、Vermentino di Gallura DOCG、Carignano del Sulcis：在独立灌木式树形、西北风与大海之间认识撒丁岛葡萄酒。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/sardegna-cannonau-vermentino.jpg?v=1c107491" length="318665" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/sardegna-cannonau-vermentino.jpg?v=1c107491" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>科利奥：意大利白葡萄酒学会认真做酒的地方</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.23/kelio-yidali-baiputaojiu-zhuiqiu-zhijia/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.23/kelio-yidali-baiputaojiu-zhuiqiu-zhijia/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>庞卡土壤、弗留拉诺（原Tocai）、白里波拉、马尔瓦西亚，还有一条穿过葡萄园的国界：为什么科利奥是意大利顶级白葡萄酒的故乡。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/friuli-collio-grandi-bianchi.jpg?v=6673bf09" length="280903" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/friuli-collio-grandi-bianchi.jpg?v=6673bf09" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>明信片之外的普利亚：普里米蒂沃、黑曼罗与特洛亚黑</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.22/puglia-mingxinpian-zhiwai-primitivo-negroamaro/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.22/puglia-mingxinpian-zhiwai-primitivo-negroamaro/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>产区</category><description>从运酒罐车到值得收藏的产区：普里米蒂沃、黑曼罗、特洛亚黑，还有萨伦托的桃红葡萄酒，抛开明信片来讲讲普利亚。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/puglia-primitivo-negroamaro.jpg?v=30cf51aa" length="271887" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/puglia-primitivo-negroamaro.jpg?v=30cf51aa" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item><item><title>有机、生物动力、自然：三个词，三个世界</title><link>https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.22/youji-shengwu-dongli-ziran-putaojiu-sange-shijie/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://vinofilo.com/zh/articles/2026.09.22/youji-shengwu-dongli-ziran-putaojiu-sange-shijie/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200</pubDate><category>工艺</category><description>有机是一部法律，生物动力是一个私人认证标志，自然则是一句没有定义的承诺。三种葡萄酒标签的背后，到底藏着什么。</description><enclosure url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/biologico-biodinamico-naturale.jpg?v=4cc60a98" length="296738" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://vinofilo.com/assets/img/biologico-biodinamico-naturale.jpg?v=4cc60a98" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1536" height="1024"/></item></channel></rss>
